2026-07-27T06:41:33.5208837Z i /tmp/Rtmpc73PoT/duckdb
2026-07-27T06:41:33.5209194Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T06:41:33.5209561Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T06:41:33.5210539Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T06:41:33.5211042Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T06:41:33.5211729Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T06:41:33.5212258Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
